each a different color, running in the same direction but starting/ending at different positions.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1172698180/1/des.md:2:- `description`：根据边框颜色配对信封与信纸，将信纸按信封开口方向折叠后嵌入信封内部。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1172698180/1/des.md:12:  - 第二步（折叠方向推断）：观察信封的开口朝向哪一侧（上/下/左/右）。开口的对侧即为\"折叠铰链边\"。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1172698180/1/des.md:13:  - 第三步（折叠与嵌入）：将信纸沿折叠铰链边做一次镜像翻折——若铰链在下则信纸占据信封内腔下半部分，翻折后的副本填充上半部分；若铰链在左则信纸占据左半部分，副本填充右半部分；以此类推。翻折后信纸颜色不变，将整个折叠结果写入信封内腔。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1172698180/1/des.md:16:- `Key insight`：开口位置不直接决定信纸放置方式——需要先推断开口的对侧为铰链，再沿铰链做镜像翻折，才能得到正确的内腔填充。配对依靠颜色匹配，折叠方向依靠开口几何推理，两层推理缺一不可。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed138090197/4/prompt.md:82:Align parallel colored line segments so they all share the same start and end positions as a reference line.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed138090197/4/prompt.md:86:- Several parallel line segments (diagonal, horizontal, or vertical), each a different color, running in the same direction but starting/ending at different positions.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1172698180/3/prompt.md:12:Fill the parallelogram-shaped region between parallel anti-diagonal line segments with red.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed401141254/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:244:Swing an irregular line segment around a nearby obstacle sprite, preserving its pixel count.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed401141254/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:258:  \"summary\": \"An irregular line segment connected to the terminal of a vertical/horizontal bar perpendicular to grid edge wraps around a nearby obstacle sprite and repositions while preserving total pixel count.\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed401141254/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:260:  \"src\": \"irregular line segment attached to terminal of edge-perpendicular bar s\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1172698180/2/prompt.md:332:Swing an irregular line segment around a nearby obstacle sprite, preserving its pixel count.\n/home/lixinyu/sn